{
  "pageElements": [
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "innerHTML": "Map Loading time"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "The maps on this site are in high resolutio.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "Depending on where you live or on your internet quality this can make the loading long.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "The site use a cache system so that the maps are only long to load the first time.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "Also when an update is made on the map.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "br"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "The \"Map\" section of the menu provides two options regarding this:<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "br"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "Check maps: will give you a report of your cache state.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "br"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "Preload maps: will download missing maps and update out dated ones. It can take several minutes.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "You can still use the site during preload.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "You can close your browser and restart later.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "You can click on \"Check maps\" to see the progress.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "It will give you a report at the end.<br>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "innerHTML": "Explore Mode"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "This mode allows you to explore the maps in deep.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "It is possible to hide or show layers of information from the menu.<br>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "innerHTML": "Learn Mode"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "This mode allows you to learn and test your knowledge of calls.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "Move your mouse over the ?????? to reveal the calls.<br>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "innerHTML": "Strat Mode"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "This mode allows you to draw a strategy on a map.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "It is possible export/import those to share them with other users.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "br"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "1 - Select your team operators by clicking on the \"?\" in the top middle of the screen.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "&emsp;This will update the team items on the left and right of the screen.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "&emsp;If two operators have the same color, change it by clicking on the color picker bellow the \"?\".<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "br"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "2 - Select your start side, mode and site by clicking on the \"?\" in the top right of the screen.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "&emsp;This will update the site locations on the map.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "br"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "3 - Select icons to drop or pen for a specific operator in the teams' items on the left and right of the screen.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "&emsp;Use the mouse to drop icons or draw with the pen.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "br"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "4 - Click on the \"Info\" button and write something about your strategy.<br>"
        },
        {
          "type": "br"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "5 - Click on the \"Export\" button to save the strategy on your device.<br>"
        }
      ]
    },
